   "proposition": "English says in-line R code in a YAML value is preceded by `r` WITHIN BACK-TICKS; the Spanish says it is preceded by `r` 'entre comillas' (within quotes), which the adjacent YAML example (date: \"`r Sys.Date()`\") contradicts.",
